    {
     "kind": "passthrough",
     "alias": "t4"
    },
    {
     "kind": "passthrough",
     "alias": "l4"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "why": "an alias count as Nova reads it: a zero or negative count asks for none, an alias without a name is none, spaces and any script's digits are read",
